<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA FINAL TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA FINAL TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the second day</p>
<p>of the third and final test between South Africa and India at</p>
<p>the Wanderers on Friday:</p>
<p>India first innings (overnight 233-3):</p>
<p> V.Rathore c Richardson b Adams	   13</p>
<p> N.Mongia b Donald			    21</p>
<p> R.Dravid c Pollock b Cronje	     148</p>
<p> S.Tendulkar c McMillan b Cronje	  35</p>
<p> S.Ganguly c McMillan b Klusener	  73</p>
<p> M.Azharuddin c Hudson b Klusener	 18</p>
<p> V.Laxman retired hurt			 0</p>
<p> A.Kumble c Richardson b Klusener	 29</p>
<p> J.Srinath c Hudson b Donald		41</p>
<p> D.Ganesh c Cullinan b Donald		1</p>
<p> V.Prasad not out				2</p>
<p> Extras (lb-15 nb-9 w-5)		    29</p>
<p> Total					   410</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-25 2-46 3-100 4-245 5-266 6-327 7-403</p>
<p>8-408 9-410</p>
<p>Bowling: Donald 32.1-9-88-3 (w3), Pollock 30-11-55-0 (nb6),</p>
